---
description: Live Power BI DirectQuery dashboards on Snowflake views
globs: bi-github-pack/powerbi-snowflake-live-agents/**
alwaysApply: false
---

When editing this pack:

- Keep semantic models in DirectQuery mode (`mode: directQuery`).
- Source Power BI tables from Snowflake **views**, not raw landing tables.
- Prefer the manifest + `python3 -m generator.cli generate` path over hand-writing entire PBIP trees.
- Overview pages stay sparse; put detail on drillthrough pages.
- Do not commit secrets, `.pbix`, or live account passwords.
